      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "091840f4387e8c74176b274de0769a34f34c6a8af6e72c5f39f99a71a9d10738",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "bded33fad5574960ab92e621d137a6fa801a6da8cbc67366583f42c947b4f4cc",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "9ba956944e4d24a996017335dc9a0a2269478ebab9fecba20dd92a3beffe44f0",
      "text": "Deterministic Evals",
      "hash": "ddbfd76057afa8fb206a1cb033ce8530c3f7a9054f8e6ff8958047d270f65b37"
    },
    {
      "id": "ade622b0780899ac059b12eff06f98931e944cc1635e7156812a7710e7732409",
      "text": "LLM-as-a-Judge",
      "hash": "631a7d1620448d00463f18badf1ecbec9e1852c0f9139385406d6145a0ac3786"
    },
    {
      "id": "c43bcece61defef1919e5074005e595ba558e4ccc8d59c8c799224cbddc044b6",
      "text": "Human Feedback",
      "hash": "95ac34789bda4660412458f3a7fcd656943a45d667cf4457f3f7b2fabd5cc3d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "4bbb6a71718d220406c5059b693553cee61ab3273b58b616c72928db6a2ba06b",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "5439314dcf35f834d5b0811e403ebed91ee4bb8fc81435ee6eb6280d0b022ccf",
      "text": "Deterministic evals are evals that return a pass/fail result. They seek to extract determinism from a probabilistic system.",
      "hash": "b20e94cd8145e80ef26b4a4f193d656bd43e817bccab3cebfe99460f5858ccca"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b2d6e8c00c7b00202ab80a9ee3febdd5f0734fa1ba483eeb1be6f5371cdd990",
      "text": "They are the \"most useful kind of eval\" according to",
      "hash": "f0b75db21d8eb476a7200ecd1ba7e9a210cea3d1886241348456507dfab4a9b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "53171709262bd91411365cf803b9f1c09066d9cac5658247eb25c0902fa77e84",
      "text": "Ian Webster",
      "hash": "48e1505c46dfb2107e1a820fadab2a25dec333843ea58b8065509a28dd5327a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "56286b3b1e22a76444c9b1e9bcbbf7e2f05430096266852e2b103cfa97de4207",
      "text": ". These evals should be fast, and developer focused.",
      "hash": "3518a6e3d7e7c255257d0c233e2a3659cf1c14846c96418ba10e7453f5243e88"
    },
    {
      "id": "a993e73f720f165371e560b2eafe946ea9be4b3801d4ebd5d7c79b767afeead5",
      "text": "A brilliant example is from Discord's",
      "hash": "4a4375974156b128db5cb68d47c8d9d74e82897ac1f1fb9f190a0174aca0589f"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a7faa856e76242c520d0f162b3186db96b695d44d8112ca96139592573e608d",
      "text": ", where they checked that their AI bot, Clyde, always replied with a lowercase letter at the beginning of its messages. This meant that their bot was imitating the behavior of a Gen-Z user.",
      "hash": "a9d2bc33ad4f3550b2c5374e65c14ec7b3a6c0221ae3246ecbac103ea361b930"
    },
    {
      "id": "5ab2f5ce9d13b1e1d83144d5c0a682043211a891f42d6c887abdcc5d03919ce7",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "b023439992615b6130f86e6353c44420d5dea99bed88650cfaf37b589e21e2a7",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "93624c831a26dd0b77845e2e8346e6fb460f4499c291e19035ed5abf8bf036e8",
      "text": "Some evaluations can be done via LLM's.",
      "hash": "93bffac40995ef26912cc1c48486f8d8eecc72421b33202d784114106026230d"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec9c54465e4d2b9d9b1439112cbf06eba92b6feaef668e3569d496aa6692c231",
      "text": "templates are a good example of various types of these evals.",
      "hash": "7c319523fbfded445ec2ebdd41bd1c26a9b1d9d42aeedecdc1ce60c505f11c13"
    },
    {
      "id": "0515701d8541777ada3628313cc0ee3da36c9d69b89fcc2ee7fe8dad22cc809a",
      "text": "Humor",
      "hash": "8a590611f49c89d56e80d6b409a1151477120d8e8acadac4ab343e640fdd15e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "886b44fb33ef5c56912d15c7d83927ac03c6bf15499cde02bf4bb2d6b06f7316",
      "text": "judges if something is funny.",
      "hash": "2d22b32f48c3d6f224c7b18aeafdfbe0e6f9e0bbcc8b5321cad50d3ce2d2ea44"
    },
    {
      "id": "22b2ec96797cf63f0ddef4ce2f490e55c88f593f2dbd1ba2873765a13637a81c",
      "text": "Battle",
      "hash": "1b18ebbc3f490c845c2ebeca8853fcc82daefc66068eb984a445f8b1b7068438"
    },
    {
      "id": "522f4bda563e87067b3e434cfd8a1d421b6f3c5b337844a8e03bd5b0fa0f3963",
      "text": "compares two responses to find which one is better.",
      "hash": "65bdc80e158d857b9f76c20b250cb6e4a7d751f6bb68e9b018318980c3bdfc62"
    },
    {
      "id": "97dd1a695c7fc6f97f37d5567179aea66a1c27c503e550376ecf567008cfa10f",
      "text": "You can even use LLM's to check factuality, by providing a ground truth statement to check the response against.",
      "hash": "f4ef8ce73fd83f3e7126df70d780e1d1ef7b3c117ab255b6d24b1d257deb3623"
    },
    {
      "id": "142e2f7a382cc234fa326c2a0ae484591fd2c368187846ea78834520345f9ac9",
      "text": "Failing a LLM-as-a-judge evaluator is often a good indicator that a human should take a look. So, it's more like a smoke test than a real test (personal opinion).",
      "hash": "b03803a6f2fcf910bd9c7548204cc23dff6048dff18c21b927c13192123c018d"
    },
    {
      "id": "db50bc7e470fd925f6024416b44485753696d52e5759e7220b6402a5bd4fd23c",
      "text": "Some evals can only be usefully evaluated by humans. These involve long-form text generation and certain types of factuality.",
      "hash": "22b0f0da1ec38a422a7364c33ae27487a95a54e578e7c32b4c5cd79c8ef79d96"
    },
    {
      "id": "595152ddc77e959b56e8f86b69855b6225a0d719e2511b2894dba8b7c5e94c99",
      "text": "Human oversight is needed for any type of LLM app.",
      "hash": "69e43c6e1e37b49c8b669c7ffd932ad3dce5810ff811fd30f97d7c06873ed3ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "3daaf52b33adbc8ae1333249be3fc819b244ffa4d7e464c1a974c2181e731502",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
